        "created_at": "2017-09-26T18:24:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And Nigel is taller than his bro.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That fits the theme between them Before powers Nigel was the older, taller (better looking ?) ,more successful brother. Be probably was better with the ladies/men too. I bet Hugh worshiped his brother before the accident and that's a big part of why he wants to help him. The little brother stepping out of the shadows.</p>",
