      {
        "id": 203877,
        "name": "Katsue",
        "username": "Katsue",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-26T21:31:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jesse_garcia_87\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jesse_garcia_87/48/2102_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jesse_garcia_87:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>2 that shock me are Proletariat (always imagined Russians as being big and burly, not short little dudes) and Spite (just for some reason i always figured him at, like, 5 and a half foot, not the 6'1\" he actually is.)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Moscow, which is where he was born, was one of the areas affected by the Soviet famine of 1932-1933. If he achieved adulthood during the war, which his bio kind of implies*, then his growth might have been stunted by malnutrition.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>It says he was in active service near the end of the war, but Moscow was near the frontline in 1941-1942 - you'd have expected him to be called up around that time, so not just near the end of the war.</li>\n</ul>",
