        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/theta_sigma/{size}/1929_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-27T07:36:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_average_human_height_worldwide I know it's Wikipedia, but still. The average height of men in Russia in 2004 is listed as 5'10, and in general humans are getting taller and heavier over time... Not to mention potential drops in average height following wars</p>",
